### Lemon Law Attorney Near You in California

This lemon law office was created to make the [California lemon law process](/info/how-it-works) as easy to you, the consumer, as possible. Although we always enjoy meeting with our clients in person, the majority of lemon law cases can be handled without an in-person meeting. But, should we need to meet with our lemon law clients, the lemon law attorneys at our office travel to you. And, should we need to file a lawsuit for your California lemon law case, it will be filed in your local courthouse. Therefore, the lemon law lawyers at this office travel to every county in the State. Whether you live in the smallest county in Northern California or the largest cities in Southern California, you can access your nearest lemon law lawyers.

The California lemon law requires the manufacturer of your car, boat, RV, etc. to pay for all costs and expenses incurred litigating your lemon law case, including travel expenses. Therefore, there is no cost to you for any of our California lemon law lawyers’s travel time, cost or expense.
